# hardware run: stress build, PATTERN=1 VC_MODE=2, normal
# board: Arty A7-100T (xc7a100t), Digilent 210319C088F2A
# date: 2026-09-12
# RTL: main (0e7525f) + constant-tdest guard at the mesh ingress (noc_mesh_2x2_vc section 2.3)
# MARK_DEBUG 1104 nets -> 5 ILA cores / 55 probes / 1100 bits
# timing: WNS +0.489 ns (was +0.820); worst path is unchanged in kind — router 0 input-buffer
